※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4615 LANG_ARENA_VALUE_GIVEN_BACK

※ A field given something made in an arena makes the record hold it: what the record was made
※ in grows by that arena, and is never replaced, the other fields still holding what they did.
※ Reading a field of a record whose arena was given back is reading what is gone.

type R = f: str
@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let s: mut arena = ⎕arena
    let r: mut R = R(.f ← "-")
    r.f ← "a" ⧺ "b" in s
    ⎕empty(s)
    if r.f = "ab": 0u6 else: 1u6
